status GREEN -- witness, control and scan re-run here; spine clean; card under bound
recommend keep-going -- the elder lap's own recommend line still names the next work and the instrument for it now stands in the tree: one shared table is beautiful while the graph is whole, and Comlink nodes leave. Remove one node, rebuild the table from the identity, and count how many of the 719 entries change. That number is the update cost under churn, it decides whether a 270-byte shared table is usable at all, and the four shapes will not answer it alike.
